  "A loop inside another loop is a **nested loop**. For **each** iteration of the outer loop, the inner loop runs **completely**.\n\nIf the outer loop runs 3 times and the inner loop runs 4 times, the inner code runs 3 × 4 = **12** times.\n\nNested loops are great for grids, tables and patterns: rows (outer) and columns (inner).\n\nTip: `print(..., end=\"\")` keeps output on the same line, and an empty `print()` moves to the next line.",
  "Boshqa sikl ichidagi sikl — **ichma-ich sikl**. Tashqi siklning **har bir** iteratsiyasida ichki sikl **toʻliq** ishlaydi.\n\nAgar tashqi sikl 3 marta, ichki sikl 4 marta ishlasa, ichki kod 3 × 4 = **12** marta bajariladi.\n\nIchma-ich sikllar panjaralar, jadvallar va naqshlar uchun juda qulay: qatorlar (tashqi) va ustunlar (ichki).\n\nMaslahat: `print(..., end=\"\")` chiqishni oʻsha qatorda qoldiradi, boʻsh `print()` esa keyingi qatorga oʻtkazadi.",
